;;; Default Groups

; Yi Sang's color for normal text. No specific reason, and unfortunately this excludes him from
; other fun stuff
Normal        whitedark     blacklite
ColorColumn   whitelite     blackdark       bold
; Gregor: Much of his pain is concealed and his own arm's abilities remain concealed
Conceal       browndark     whitelite
Cursor        whitedark     blacklite       reverse

; Faust: navigating information
Directory     magentalite   blacklite       bold

DiffAdd       yellowdark    whitelite       reverse
; Meursault: Changed text; rote repetition of fact.
DiffChange    bluedark      whitelite       reverse
DiffDelete    brownlite     whitelite       reverse
; Heathcliff: No particular reason, needed a dark color to match the scheme
DiffText      magentadark   whitelite       reverse

; Sinclair: An end is a beginning; "One who seeks to be born must first destroy a world"
EndOfBuffer   greenlite     blackdark

; Rodion: Something is not quite right with her (also red text usually is reserved for errors)
ErrorMsg      reddark       whitelite       reverse

; Ryoshu: How could I not make "Vertical Split" Ryoshu's color?
VertSplit     redlite       blackdark       reverse

; Outis: Summarizing this section for you, Manager
Folded        greendark     whitelite       reverse,bold

; Outis: Same as above (a column within a folded bit of information)
FoldColumn    greendark     blackdark

; Ishmael: Knowledgable about directions
SignColumn    orangelite    whitelite       reverse

; Hong Lu: Searching with the precious jade eye
IncSearch     cyanlite      whitelite       reverse,bold

; Ishamel: Charting a course (line numbers help navigation)
LineNr        orangelite    blacklite      
CursorLineNr  orangelite    blacklite       bold

MessageWindow yellowdark    blacklite       italic

ModeMsg       whitedark     blacklite       bold
; Faust: Accumulating Messages
MsgArea       magentalite   blackdark

PmenuKind     cyandark      blackdark
PmenuThumb    cyandark      blackdark       reverse

; Heathcliff: Oi! Clockhead!
PopupSelected magentadark   whitelite       reverse,bold
PopupNotification
              magentadark   whitelite

Question      bluelite      blacklite       italic

; Don Quixote: Manager Esquire! This requires your attention!
QuickFixLine  yellowlite    blacklite       reverse

; Hong Lu: Same as above (searching with the precious jade eye)
Search        cyanlite      whitelite       reverse
CurSearch     cyanlite      whitelite       bold

; Rodion: Same color as error text...
SpellBad      reddark       whitelite       underline
; Outis: Attention! This word requires prompt capitalization! (Also fits colorscheme)
SpellCap      greendark     whitelite       underline
; Heathcliff: What'dya mean this shite is a "local" spelling?
SpellLocal    magentadark   whitelite       underline
; Meursault: Rare spelling; knowledgable on technicality
SpellRare     bluedark      whitelite       underline

; Faust: Commanding and directing Limbus
StatusLine    magentalite   whitelite       reverse,bold
StatusLineNC  magentalite   whitelite       bold

StatusLineTerm
              tandark       whitedark       reverse,bold
StatusLineTermNC
              tandark       whitedark       bold

; Ishmael: Deciding which path to take (choosing between options)
TabLine       orangelite    blackdark       reverse
TabLineSel    orangelite    blackdark       bold

; Outis:  I am quite knowledgable about rank and title on the field of battle!
Title         greendark     whitelite       italic

; Hong Lu: This actually fits Meursault better (gaze bearing) but
; I like Search and Visual selections to appear the same
Visual        cyanlite      blacklite       reverse
; Gregor: Fit the colorscheme here...
VisualNOS     browndark     whitelite       reverse,bold

; Meursault: Warning; informs the manager of potential issues
WarningMsg    bluedark      whitelite

;;; Special Groups
; Outis: Here is a detailed report Manager!
Comment       greendark     blacklite

; Hong Lu: Constant because he never lost his kindness (and because I like this color)
Constant      cyanlite      blacklite
Boolean       orangedark    blacklite

Identifier    tanlite       blacklite

Statement     bluelite      blacklite
; Sinclair: Represents change and potential (makes sense for a light green to be for operators)
Operator      greenlite     blacklite

; Ryoshu: Handles preprocessing because of her relationship with time
PreProc       redlite       blacklite
PreCondit     redlite       blacklite       reverse,bold

; Faust: No reason for type (perhaps how strongly she typecasts herself).
; I just like the color
Type          magentalite   blacklite       bold
StorageClass  tandark       blacklite       bold

Special       cyandark      blacklite
; Don Quixote: Out of the ordinary text- She's very loud and attention grabbing
Delimeter     yellowlite    blacklite       reverse,bold

; Ishmael: Adventuring to a new place (clicking a hyperlink)
Underlined    orangelite    blacklite       underline
; Gregor: Constantly pushed aside
Ignore        browndark     whitelite       strikethrough
